	//
	// **Returns:** 204 No Content.
	//
	// **Raises**
	//
	// - `OmnigentError` — 404 if no session or no access, 403 when the target holds the owner grant, 400 when leaving a sub-agent session, 401 if unauthenticated.
	//
	// Returns a wrapper object for the known response body format(s).
